invariant: INV-62
file: mldsa_sign_pack.c
catches: test/lint-wide-multiply.sh
reason: A pass of RejBoundedPoly's compaction moves a kept entry down
  behind a branch on its move, in place of the masked choice at every
  position. The values are the same, so no test of a key sees it, but the
  branch reads the secret stream of s1 and s2. lint-wide-multiply's
  branch count for mldsa_sign_pack.c rises over its ceiling.

--- old
        entries[p] = eta_choose(one, entries[p], entries[p + step], bit);
--- new
        uint32_t above = entries[p + step];
        if (((above >> 3) & (above >> (MLDS_ETA_MOVE_AT + bit)) & 1U) != 0) {
            entries[p] = (uint16_t)above;
        } else {
            entries[p] = eta_choose(one, entries[p], 0U, bit);
        }
